[GA Alliance]
If you have not finished Kirtonos the Herald, run Scholomance first to start the Doctor Theolen Krastinov chain that leads to Stratholme. Tick this step when you are ready for Stratholme.
[OC]Travel to Stromgarde Keep in Arathi Highlands
[G 28.26,62.33,30 Arathi Highlands]Loot the *Keepsake of Remembrance* in Stromgarde Keep \\ It is a little red book which can be located in any of the fireplaces inside the keep. Also check the Ogre Tower and the intact houses \\ [QC5461,1 The Human, Ras Frostwhisper]
[OC]Travel to Western Plaguelands
[OC]Equip the *Spectral Essence* you received from the previous quest to be able to see *Magistrate Marduke* \\ If you lost it you can ask *Eva Sarkhoff* for another[UI13544-]
[G 70.54,73.99 Western Plaguelands]Talk to *Magistrate Marduke* \\ Turn in [QT5461 The Human, Ras Frostwhisper] \\ Accept [QA5462 The Dying, Ras Frostwhisper][UI13544-] \\ If you are leaving the Ras Frostwhisper chain for later, tick this step.
