[OC]Use *Egan's Blaster* on *Spectral Citizens* and *Ghostly Citizen*. \\ *Restless Souls* will appear. Use it on them too \\ [QC5282,1 The Restless Souls][UI13289-]
[A IT13180<5][O]If you are collecting water for *Houses of the Holy*, loot *Supply Crates* scattered around the instance. Loot them for *Stratholme Holy Water* \\ Some of the crates are traps and contain poison or hostile bugs inside \\ If careful you can tell them apart as when you move close to a trapped crate "disarm trap" will appear on the tooltip \\ Collect five *Stratholme Holy Water*. [QC5243,1 Houses of the Holy] Tick this reminder if you leave the dungeon without all five.
Take a left into the alleyway coming from the entrance of the living side \\ Click on the *Premium Grimm Tobacco* box on the ground at the end of it \\ *Ezra Grimm* will spawn. Kill him and loot him for *Grimm's Premium Tobacco* \\ Be careful as he will aggro every *Undead* in an extremely large radius \\ [QC5214,1 The Great Ezra Grimm]
[OC]Use *Egan's Blaster* on *Spectral Citizens* and *Ghostly Citizen*. \\ *Restless Souls* will appear. Use it on them too \\ [QC5282,1 The Restless Souls][UI13289-]
Kill *Archivist Galford*. Click the *Scarlet Archive* on the table \\ [QC5251,1 The Archivist] \\ [QC5251,2 The Archivist]
[O]Loot the *painting* on the wall in *Archivist Galford's* room \\ [QC5848,1 Of Love and Family] \\ If you skipped Of Love and Family, tick off its remaining optional steps.
[OC]If possible, return to Light's Hope Chapel now to turn in "The Archivist" BEFORE killing *Grand Crusader Dathrohan* *(Balnazzar)* as this will allow you to loot *Head of Balnazzar*
